# Commit message drafts, written to be passed to `git commit -F` and deleted.
# The content lives in the commit; the file is scratch. Ignored so it cannot be
# swept in by `git add -A`, which is how COMMIT_MSG_phase2_rounding.txt was
# committed on 2026-09-21.
COMMIT_MSG*.txt

